{#title}
> # gbrc
> ## A tool for recompiling Game Boy games into native executables for any platform
>
> {style="text-align: center; margin-top: 60px;"}
> [Mukesh Reddy](https://mukesh.0xc84.fyi)&sup1;, [Rohith Vinod](https://rohith.net)&sup2;
